  "body": "If a user has been explicitly deactivated they find themselves logged out and unable to log back in other than to be told their password is unrecognised.\r\n\r\nTo solve this add a flag to users table on deactivation and then return the appropriate error response when the deactivated user tries to log back in so they at least know what has happened.",
